-- "Trưa nay ăn gì?": phone numbers for the quán already in the library, and
-- 99 more quán in Tân Bình, Phú Nhuận and Quận 3 — from Google Maps
-- (2026-10-01): open at lunch, rated 4.0+ by at least 50 people, within
-- ~3.5 km of the office. Address, phone, opening hours (weekday), price per
-- person and the Google rating come from there; each gets the món it is
-- named for with a free Unsplash illustration. Run once in the Supabase
-- Dashboard SQL Editor; running it again adds nothing twice.

-- Phones for the quán added earlier (Foody doesn't publish them). Only
-- fills an empty phone — a number someone typed in the app is kept.
update public.food_shops s set phone = v.phone, updated_at = now()
from (values
